    "polity": "Kingdom of the Two Sicilies",
    "present": false,
    "regime": "twosicilies",
    "seeded_from_archive": false,
    "to": 1861,
    "to_margin": 1,
    "url": "/region/calabria/#era-1815",
    "why": "Ferdinand restored by the Treaty of Casalanza 20 May 1815 (Tolentino 2 or 3 May; Congress of Vienna 9 Jun 1815), but the Kingdom of the Two Sicilies is created only on 8 Dec 1816 (Wikipedia Two Sicilies and Naples infoboxes; Treccani: 1816). De facto restoration 1815 versus de jure union 1816 is a gap of about 19 months. FIX: polity for 1815-1816 should read Kingdom of Naples (restored Bourbon); 'Two Sicilies' from 8 Dec 1816. No source fetched shows a split of authority in Calabria itself in 1815-1860 apart from the 1860-61 change (covered under 1861)."
   },
